WEBVTT

00:12:58.672 --> 00:13:00.362
It doesn't make them good people,

00:13:00.786 --> 00:13:03.078
but it's at the heart of engineering,

00:13:03.102 --> 00:13:07.632
at the heart of a creative community,
an innovative community,

00:13:07.656 --> 00:13:10.521
and the open source community,
the basic ethos of it

00:13:10.545 --> 00:13:14.053
is, take what other people do,
make it better,

00:13:14.077 --> 00:13:16.241
give it back so we all rise further.

00:13:16.265 --> 00:13:18.654
Very similar communities, very similar.

00:13:18.678 --> 00:13:20.669
We have our edgier sides, too.

00:13:20.693 --> 00:13:21.898
(Laughter)

00:13:21.922 --> 00:13:23.385
It's funny, my dad was right.

00:13:23.409 --> 00:13:24.789
These are my peers.

00:13:25.908 --> 00:13:28.492
But I respect what they do,
and they respect what I do,

00:13:28.516 --> 00:13:31.265
because they can do things,
it's amazing what they can do.